{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06394","headline":"送康洽入京进乐府歌 · 李颀","name":"送康洽入京进乐府歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"识子十年何不遇，只爱欢游两京路。\n朝吟左氏娇女篇，夜诵相如美人赋。\n长安春物旧相宜，小苑蒲萄花满枝。\n柳色偏浓九华殿，莺声醉杀五陵儿。\n曳裾此日从何所，中贵由来尽相许。\n白裌春衫仙吏赠，乌皮隐几台郎与。\n新诗乐府唱堪愁，御妓应传鳷鹊楼。\n西上虽因长公主，终须一见曲陵侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}